        at␀␀
        Examples
        --------
        >>> df = pd.DataFrame({"A": [1, 2, 3], "B": [4, 5, 6], "C": [7, 8, 9]})
        >>> df
           A  B  C
        0  1  4  7
        1  2  5  8
        2  3  6  9

        >>> df.rolling(2, win_type="boxcar").agg("mean")
             A    B    C
        0  NaN  NaN  NaN
        1  1.5  4.5  7.5
        2  2.5  5.5  8.5
