        See Also
        --------
        pandas.Series.rolling : Calling object with Series data.
        pandas.DataFrame.rolling : Calling object with DataFrame data.
        aì␀␀
        Examples
        --------
        >>> df = pd.DataFrame({"A": [1, 2, 3], "B": [4, 5, 6], "C": [7, 8, 9]})
        >>> df
           A  B  C
        0  1  4  7
        1  2  5  8
        2  3  6  9

        >>> df.rolling(2).sum()
             A     B     C
        0  NaN   NaN   NaN
        1  3.0   9.0  15.0
        2  5.0  11.0  17.0

        >>> df.rolling(2).agg({"A": "sum", "B": "min"})
             A    B
        0  NaN  NaN
        1  3.0  4.0
        2  5.0  5.0
